{
  "declaredLength": 2180,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的警察\n会请宝可梦来协助侦查。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F776848B665BDF000A4F1A8BF75B9D53EF68A66765534F52A94FA667E53002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我现在很关注\n怨影娃娃这种宝可梦的特征。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621173B057285F8851736CE8000A60285F715A035A038FD979CD5B9D53EF68A6768472795F813002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说怨影娃娃喜欢\n人类的怨恨、嫉妒这类负面感情。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E8BF460285F715A035A03559C6B22000A4EBA7C7B76846028606830015AC959928FD97C7B8D1F9762611F60C53002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说，借助怨影娃娃的力量，\n就能找到积累了许多负面感情的人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C501F52A960285F715A035A037684529B91CFFF0C000A5C3180FD627E523079EF7D2F4E868BB8591A8D1F9762611F60C576844EBA3002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这说不定能对逮捕犯人有所帮助，\n或是让案件防患于未然。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD98BF44E0D5B9A80FD5BF9902E635572AF4EBA670962405E2E52A9FF0C000A6216662F8BA968484EF6963260A34E8E672A71363002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是我希望你也能出把力！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你要是带着怨影娃娃的话，\n能不能让1只给我呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F62115E0C671B4F604E5F80FD51FA628A529BFF0100100001BE01000A4F608981662F5E26774060285F715A035A0376848BDDFF0C000A80FD4E0D80FD8BA9003153EA7ED962115462FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意把怨影娃娃让给我吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F628A60285F715A035A038BA97ED962115417FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "愿意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "613F610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦～！\n要给我哪只怨影娃娃呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF5EFF01000A89817ED9621154EA53EA60285F715A035A035462FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是能借助\n怨影娃娃的力量该多好啊……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F80FD501F52A9000A60285F715A035A037684529B91CF8BE5591A597D554A20262026001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你就是怨影娃娃呀！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C31662F60285F715A035A035440FF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的和平就靠你了！\n让我见识一下你的力量吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F77684548C5E735C3197604F604E86FF01000A8BA9621189C18BC64E004E0B4F607684529B91CF5427FF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎～呀……好大啊！\n把密阿雷的和平交给你肯定没问题！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CEFF5E544020262026597D5927554AFF01000A628A5BC6963F96F77684548C5E734EA47ED94F6080AF5B9A6CA195EE9898FF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话是这么说，\n但它不可能马上发挥作用吧……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD662F8FD94E488BF4FF0C000A4F465B834E0D53EF80FD9A6C4E0A53D163254F5C7528542720262026001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怨～哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6028FF5E54C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这么快就对负面感情起反应了？\n好！我们去追吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E485FEB5C315BF98D1F9762611F60C58D7753CD5E944E86FF1F000A597DFF0162114EEC53BB8FFD54273002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎……怎么回事？\n这里……是我家啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E20262026600E4E4856DE4E8BFF1F000A8FD991CC20262026662F62115BB6554AFF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怨～哇！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6028FF5E54C7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你下班了吗？\n辛苦啦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0B73ED4E865417FF1F000A8F9B82E6556630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没有……我还在侦查。\n你看到什么可疑的家伙了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA167092026202662118FD857284FA667E53002000A4F60770B52304EC04E4853EF759176845BB64F194E865417FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……还在工作？\n……那你加油侦查吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "202620268FD857285DE54F5CFF1F000A2026202690A34F6052A06CB94FA667E5542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怨～哇！！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6028FF5E54C7FF01FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为……为什么\n你会对她起反应？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A202620264E3A4EC04E48000A4F604F1A5BF959798D7753CD5E94FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好讨厌的怨影娃娃。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n它竟然对我一直压抑在心中的\n丑陋感情起了反应。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D8BA8538C768460285F715A035A03300200100001BE01000A5B837ADF71365BF962114E0076F4538B629157285FC34E2D7684000A4E11964B611F60C58D774E8653CD5E9430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "难道说……\n怎、怎么会这样……！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96BE90538BF420262026000A600E3001600E4E484F1A8FD9683720262026FF01FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "她憎恨只知道埋头工作的我，\n但嘴上却在给我加油……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这样压抑在心中的情感\n逐渐转变成了对我的怨恨……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5979618E606853EA77E5905357CB59345DE54F5C76846211FF0C000A4F4656344E0A537457287ED9621152A06CB92026202600100001BE01000A8FD96837538B629157285FC34E2D768460C5611F000A90106E108F6C53D862104E865BF9621176846028606820262026FF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以怨影娃娃才对她心里的\n负面感情起了反应。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE560285F715A035A03624D5BF959795FC391CC7684000A8D1F9762611F60C58D774E8653CD5E943002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怨～哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6028FF5E54C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说当初是顺其自然地生活在一起的，\n但我一直以为我们是互相理解的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D8BF45F53521D662F987A517681EA71365730751F6D3B57284E008D777684FF0C000A4F4662114E0076F44EE54E3A62114EEC662F4E9276F8740689E376843002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然而光知道埋头工作的我\n却丝毫没有察觉到她心中全是不满。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n唉，我也还差得远呢……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136800C514977E5905357CB59345DE54F5C76846211000A53744E1D6BEB6CA167095BDF89C9523059795FC34E2D5168662F4E0D6EE1300200100001BE01000A5509FF0C62114E5F8FD85DEE5F978FDC546220262026001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怨影娃娃，\n今后你也要帮我啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60285F715A035A03FF0C000A4ECA540E4F604E5F89815E2E6211554A3002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了不再让她压抑自己的情感，\n也为了我能成为更好的伴侣，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你要是有发现的话，一定要告诉我啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E864E0D518D8BA95979538B629181EA5DF1768460C5611FFF0C000A4E5F4E3A4E86621180FD62104E3A66F4597D76844F344FA3FF0C00100001BE00000A4F608981662F670953D173B076848BDDFF0C4E005B9A8981544A8BC96211554A3002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我总是忍不住去想不开心的事。\n这样会变得讨厌自己……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211603B662F5FCD4E0D4F4F53BB60F34E0D5F005FC376844E8B3002000A8FD968374F1A53D85F978BA8538C81EA5DF1202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怨～哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6028FF5E54C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然对不起怨影娃娃，\n但我会努力不让她有负面感情的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71365BF94E0D8D7760285F715A035A03FF0C000A4F4662114F1A52AA529B4E0D8BA9597967098D1F9762611F60C576843002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    }
  ],
